HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4301f8e3, "` is the library's own `extern` \342\200\224 an extern is never reachable across a module boundary, and the library is a module");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5e119d2f, "\302\2474.19: every extern the library declares is wrapped by a library function, and the wrapper is the route \342\200\224 it adds the checks the raw extern does not have");
